{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":10,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 10:1"},"Why standest thou afar off, O LORD? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["why"]}," hidest thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thyself "]},"in times of trouble? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 10:2"},"The wicked in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," pride doth persecute the poor: let them be taken in the devices that they have imagined. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 10:3"},"For the wicked boasteth of his heart’s desire, and blesseth the covetous, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["whom"]}," the LORD abhorreth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 10:4"},"The wicked, through the pride of his countenance, will not seek ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["after God:"]}," God ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," not in all his thoughts. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 10:5"},"His ways are always grievous; thy judgments ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," far above out of his sight: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as for"]}," all his enemies, he puffeth at them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 10:6"},"He hath said in his heart, I shall not be moved: for ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["I shall "]},"never ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," in adversity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 10:7"},"His mouth is full of cursing and deceit and fraud: under his tongue ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," mischief and vanity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 10:8"},"He sitteth in the lurking places of the villages: in the secret places doth he murder the innocent: his eyes are privily set against the poor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 10:9"},"He lieth in wait secretly as a lion in his den: he lieth in wait to catch the poor: he doth catch the poor, when he draweth him into his net. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 10:10"},"He croucheth, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," humbleth himself, that the poor may fall by his strong ones. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 10:11"},"He hath said in his heart, God hath forgotten: he hideth his face; he will never see ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:11"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PSA 10:12"},"Arise, O LORD; O God, lift up thine hand: forget not the humble. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:12"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PSA 10:13"},"Wherefore doth the wicked contemn God? he hath said in his heart, Thou wilt not require ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:13"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PSA 10:14"},"Thou hast seen ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it;"]}," for thou beholdest mischief and spite, to requite ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it"]}," with thy hand: the poor committeth himself unto thee; thou art the helper of the fatherless. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:14"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PSA 10:15"},"Break thou the arm of the wicked and the evil ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man:"]}," seek out his wickedness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["till"]}," thou find none. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:15"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PSA 10:16"},"The LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," King for ever and ever: the heathen are perished out of his land. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:16"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PSA 10:17"},"LORD, thou hast heard the desire of the humble: thou wilt prepare their heart, thou wilt cause thine ear to hear: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:17"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PSA 10:18"},"To judge the fatherless and the oppressed, that the man of the earth may no more oppress. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 10:18"}]}]}
